OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome early
OL,6,Fevening brightness possible, but also
OL,7,Fisolated outbreaks of light rain. Then
OL,8,Flargely dry with clear spells
OL,9,Fovernight, allowing for some fog
OL,10,Fpatches to form in rural spots by
OL,11,Fdawn. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FEarly mist or fog patches
OL,14,Fslowly clearing to give some sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Thicker cloud and some
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain will move
OL,17,Fsoutheastwards into the afternoon.
OL,18,FWarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
