OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith rain, locally heavy, clearing
OL,7,Flater Wednesday. Chilly start
OL,8,FThursday, then sunny spells and
OL,9,Fcoastal showers. Wind and rain
OL,10,Farriving overnight, then damp and
OL,11,Fbreezy into Friday, clearing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
